    "title": "Oval centerpiece to be installed, while future remains uncertain - NewsBreak",
    "text": "By Sydney Moate / Montana Kaimin ,\n1 days ago After a near six year wait, the new Oval centerpiece was installed this morning, while a future Indigenous inscription and dedication ceremony remain uncertain. Due to crumbling and displacement, the bricks at the center of UM’s famous Oval were removed and replaced in 2020, and along with them, the old Oval seal. But unlike the bricks, the very center of campus has sat empty, concealed by a sheet of plywood. Now, after six years, the new seal is in the ground. Read full article\nRead in NewsBreak",
